cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AI-Based Dynamic Questionnaire System"
abstract: >-
  A web-based system that assembles a dynamic, culturally aware questionnaire
  for each respondent in real time. It infers a cultural orientation from a short
  set of opening questions, draws and adapts the wording of culturally matched
  items from curated banks derived from validated scales (stress: PSS, DASS-21;
  social support: MSPSS), and monitors response-time behaviour to detect fatigue
  and control questionnaire length. Case study: perceived stress and social
  support in multicultural environments.
type: software
